From 5c5fd9b4e042c1f547d878decadbab334f000f4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leocheng-tw <Leo_Cheng@phoenix.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Feb 2022 05:36:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add PHY diagnostic tool on Redfish.

---
